---
import LegalPage from "../layouts/LegalPage.astro";
import { company } from "../data/site";

const sections = [
  { id: "scope", heading: "Who we are and what this covers", body: [
    "ORVANTA CX (\"we\", \"us\") is an AI-powered BPO and contact centre service provider based in Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India. This draft policy describes how we handle personal information in connection with our website, our enquiry form and the services we provide to business clients.",
    "In some situations we handle information on behalf of a client, for example when a voice agent or chatbot talks to that client's customers. In those cases the client decides why the information is needed, and our handling is governed by the written arrangement with that client as well as this policy.",
  ]},
  { id: "enquiries", heading: "Information collected through enquiries", body: [
    "When you send an enquiry through this website we collect the details you enter: your name, business email, company name, country, the service you are interested in, your preferred language and contact method, and your project requirements. You may also choose to give a phone number, a website address, an expected call volume and the name of your current platform or telephony provider.",
    "We also record the time of the enquiry, a reference number, your consent, and technical security information used to prevent abuse. For rate limiting we store a salted, one-way hash derived from your network address; we do not store the address itself with your enquiry.",
  ]},
  { id: "client-info", heading: "Client information", body: [
    "To set up and run a service we may receive business information from clients, such as scripts, price lists, policies, opening hours, escalation contacts, and access to calendars or other systems. We ask only for what a workflow needs.",
  ]},
  { id: "conversations", heading: "Customer conversation information", body: [
    "When our AI voice agents or chatbots talk to a client's customers, the conversation may involve names, contact details, appointment requests, order or enquiry details, and whatever else the customer chooses to say. What is collected, how long it is kept and who can see it are decided in the arrangement with each client.",
  ]},
  { id: "recordings", heading: "Voice recordings and transcripts", body: [
    "Calls are not recorded, and transcripts are not kept, automatically. Recordings and transcripts are made only where a workflow has been configured for them and the legal notices and permissions that apply to that workflow are in place. Where they are enabled, they are used for the purposes agreed with the client, such as quality review and call summaries.",
  ]},
  { id: "ai", heading: "AI processing", body: [
    "Our voice agents and chatbots use speech recognition, language models and speech generation provided by third-party technology providers, selected per project. Conversation content is processed by those providers so that the service can work. AI agents are configured to answer from information the client has approved, and conversations can be passed to a person where a route has been configured.",
    "We do not use AI to make decisions about people that have legal or similarly significant effects without human involvement.",
  ]},
  { id: "purposes", heading: "Why we process information", body: [
    "We use enquiry information to respond to you, assess your requirements and prepare a quotation. We use client and conversation information to provide, test, monitor and improve the services we have agreed to provide, to report to the client, and to keep our systems secure. We may also keep records needed to meet legal or accounting obligations.",
    "We do not sell personal information.",
  ]},
  { id: "providers", heading: "Third-party service providers", body: [
    "We rely on third parties to run the website and services, which may include a hosting and database provider (Cloudflare), AI and voice technology providers, telephony providers, and an email notification provider if enabled. These providers process information only to supply their service to us. The providers in use for any engagement are agreed with the client.",
  ]},
  { id: "storage", heading: "Data storage", body: [
    "Website enquiries are stored in a Cloudflare D1 database associated with this website. Client and conversation data are stored in the systems agreed for each engagement. The location of storage depends on the providers and configuration chosen, and is confirmed to clients on request.",
  ]},
  { id: "access", heading: "Access controls", body: [
    "We aim to limit access to personal information to people who need it for their role, and to protect administrative access with strong credentials. Secrets such as API keys are kept out of the website's public files.",
  ]},
  { id: "retention", heading: "Data retention", body: [
    "We keep enquiry information for as long as is needed to respond to you and to keep a reasonable business record, and then delete or anonymise it. Retention periods for client and conversation data are set in the arrangement with each client. [Retention periods to be confirmed during legal review.]",
  ]},
  { id: "deletion", heading: "Deletion and other requests", body: [
    "You can ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you by emailing us. Where we hold information on behalf of a client, we may need to refer your request to that client. We will respond as required by the law that applies.",
  ]},
  { id: "transfers", heading: "International data transfers", body: [
    "We are based in India and work with clients in other countries. Information may therefore be processed in India and in other countries where our providers operate. Where the law requires safeguards for such transfers, we will put suitable arrangements in place. [Transfer mechanisms to be confirmed during legal review.]",
  ]},
  { id: "security", heading: "Security practices", body: [
    "We use measures such as encrypted connections, access limits, form protections against abuse, and minimal collection. No system is completely secure, and we do not claim any security certification at this time.",
  ]},
  { id: "contact", heading: "Contact for privacy enquiries", body: [
    `Email ${company.email} or call ${company.phone}. Address: ${company.location}.`,
  ]},
];
---
<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  seoTitle="Privacy Policy (Draft) | ORVANTA CX"
  description="Draft Privacy Policy for ORVANTA CX: enquiries, client and customer conversation data, AI processing, recordings, transcripts, storage and retention."
  path="/privacy-policy"
  intro="How ORVANTA CX handles personal information. Draft for legal review."
  sections={sections}
/>
